# BSDC — .prettierignore
# Purpose : Keep generated output out of the formatting gate.
# Owner   : RRC Development / BSDC Platform Team
# Rule    : `npm run format:check` runs over a wide glob so nothing hand-written escapes it. That
#           same glob reaches compiler output, which is not hand-written, cannot be formatted by
#           changing its source, and would otherwise fail the gate for a reason nobody can fix.
#           Everything listed here is produced by a build and already excluded from git.

dist/
functions/lib/
coverage/
public/icons/
public/favicon.svg
public/logo-light.svg
public/sitemap*.xml
public/feed*.xml
public/messaging-config.js
node_modules/
*.log
*.map
